WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Choose Windows, then click Download Windows trial.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Wait for the download to finish, then open the ZIP.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Click Extract all.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Choose a folder, click Extract, and wait for the files.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Run Install Gate Desk.cmd once and let installation finish.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Open the new Gate Desk desktop shortcut.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Continue with the setup instructions inside Gate Desk.
